id: cerealian-genes
name: Cerealian Genes
order: 6
category: body
importance: secondary
description: >
  Possessing the evolved right eye of the Cerealians, your talents for perception and striking vital points are unparalleled.
text: >
  Cerealian Genes [Impulsive] (Body): Possessing the evolved right eye of the Cerealians, your talents for perception and striking vital points are unparalleled.
  (1)-[Passive]: Reduce the Critical Target of your Strike Rolls by 1.
  (2)-[Passive]: You cannot suffer from the Long Range Penalty, but none of your Signature Techniques may possess the Short Range Disadvantage.
  (3)-[Triggered]: If you score a Critical Result on the Strike Roll of an Attacking Maneuver, you may spend an Adaptation Point to increase the Wound Roll of that Attacking Maneuver by 3(T).
  (4)-[Triggered]: If you score a Critical Result on the Strike Roll of an Attacking Maneuver, gain an Adaptation Point.
  (5)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: When making an Attacking Maneuver, you may spend 2 Adaptation Points to turn that Attacking Maneuver into a Called Shot without paying the additional Action Cost.
---

[passive]
# [Impulsive]: its Racial Saving Throw Bonus.
allow save.racial.impulsive;
# (1)
criticalTarget.strike -= 1;
# (2) No Long Range Penalty; the Short Range Disadvantage refused in the Technique builder (technique.mjs featureProblem).
allow longRange.ignore;
allow cerealianGenes.noShortRange;
# (3) A Critical Strike that hit: asked, with an Adaptation Point - 3(T) on its Wound Roll (chat.mjs cerealianWoundFor).
allow cerealianGenes.wound;
# (5) The Called Shot applied to an Attacking Maneuver, with 2 Adaptation Points: asked, once a Round - for them, not its Action
# (use-maneuver.mjs applyModifiers).
allow cerealianGenes.calledShot;

# (4) A Critical Result on an attack's Strike Roll. Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/critical-scored, effect 4]
requires attackStrikeRolled;
adaptation.stacks += 1;
